msgstr ""

#: 5b523b0c764f4575bd2b87266d880923 of sds.advanced.lru_cache.LRUCache:3
msgid ""
"The cache holds at most *capacity* key-value pairs. When full, the entry "
"that has not been accessed (via ``get`` or ``put``) for the longest time "
"is evicted on the next ``put``."
msgstr ""

#: 732e7c8cd52442e192558b2c9d7a61a5 of sds.advanced.lru_cache.LRUCache:7
msgid ""
"Internally, a doubly-linked list maintains access order (most recent at "
"the tail, least recent at the head) while a dict maps keys to list nodes "
"for O(1) random access."
msgstr ""

